WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.569 --> 00:00:10.309
♪ ♪

00:00:10.342 --> 00:00:13.312
- COME NOW, MARY MAGDALENE.

00:00:13.345 --> 00:00:17.150
STAND AND BE FORGIVEN
FOR YOUR SINS.

00:00:17.183 --> 00:00:21.087
- BUT, JESUS,
HOW CAN I BE FORGIVEN?

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:22.555
I'M A PROSTITUTE.

00:00:22.588 --> 00:00:24.791
- NO, CHILD.

00:00:24.824 --> 00:00:27.260
YOU WERE A PROSTITUTE.

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:29.762
THAT LIFE IS BEHIND YOU NOW.

00:00:29.795 --> 00:00:32.565
- MARY MAGDALENE!
WHERE YOU AT, BITCH?

00:00:32.598 --> 00:00:34.500
- OH, NO, JESUS.

00:00:34.533 --> 00:00:38.071
I THINK IT'S MY PIMP.
I THINK HE FOUND ME.

00:00:38.104 --> 00:00:40.073
- THERE YOU ARE!

00:00:40.106 --> 00:00:41.607
MAN, TOOK ME FOREVER
TO FIND YO ASS!

00:00:41.640 --> 00:00:43.776
I BEEN LOOKIN'
ALL OVER FOR YOU!

00:00:43.809 --> 00:00:46.145
YOU KNOW HOW MANY BITCHES
NAMED MARY THERE ARE UP IN HERE?

00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:47.280
NOW GET YOUR ASS
IN THAT CARAVAN!

00:00:47.313 --> 00:00:49.148
- NO!

00:00:49.181 --> 00:00:50.817
NO, I'M NOT
GOING WITH YOU, GALILEROY.

00:00:50.850 --> 00:00:53.386
I'M GONNA
STAY HERE WITH JESUS.

00:00:53.419 --> 00:00:55.621
- WHAT THE FLIP IS THIS?

00:00:55.654 --> 00:00:57.423
YOU WASHING
THIS [bleep] FEET?

00:00:57.456 --> 00:00:59.325
- MAYBE.
- WELL, I TAUGHT YOU THAT!

00:00:59.358 --> 00:01:01.294
I RESCUED YOU
FROM THAT FISHING VILLAGE,

00:01:01.327 --> 00:01:02.328
I CLEANED YOU UP
AND GOT YOU OUT TO WORK,

00:01:02.361 --> 00:01:04.263
AND NOW THIS IS
HOW YOU REPAY ME?

00:01:04.296 --> 00:01:05.698
YOU GO OUT AND GET YOURSELF
ANOTHER PIMP?

00:01:05.731 --> 00:01:07.600
HELL, NO, BROTHA,
SHE'S MINE.

00:01:07.633 --> 00:01:08.701
- I DON'T THINK
YOU UNDERSTAND.

00:01:08.734 --> 00:01:10.670
SHE'S NOT GOING WITH YOU.

00:01:10.703 --> 00:01:12.705
- WELL, I CAN'T AFFORD
TO LOSE HER.

00:01:12.738 --> 00:01:14.607
I ALREADY LOST THREE BITCHES
TO LEPROSY, ALL RIGHT?

00:01:14.640 --> 00:01:17.443
ALL I GOT LEFT IS MARY,
A CRIPPLE, AND TWO BLIND CHICKS,

00:01:17.476 --> 00:01:19.445
WHO--

00:01:19.478 --> 00:01:21.247
ACTUALLY, YOU KNOW,
THEY GET REQUESTED A LOT.

00:01:21.280 --> 00:01:22.715
DON'T ASK ME HOW THAT WORKS.

00:01:22.748 --> 00:01:24.484
- GET OUTTA HERE!

00:01:24.517 --> 00:01:26.519
I'M NOT GOING WITH YOU,
GALILEROY.

00:01:26.552 --> 00:01:28.254
I'M STAYING HERE WITH JESUS,
AND I'M WARNING YOU,

00:01:28.287 --> 00:01:30.690
JESUS HAS, LIKE,
12 FOLLOWERS.

00:01:30.723 --> 00:01:32.892
TELL HIM.
- OH, 12?

00:01:32.925 --> 00:01:36.362
PSSH. OKAY, ALL RIGHT, SO THIS
MOTHER[bleep] A SERIOUS PIMP.

00:01:36.395 --> 00:01:37.797
- NO, MY FRIEND.
YOU'RE CONFUSED.

00:01:37.830 --> 00:01:39.599
IT'S 12 MEN.

00:01:39.632 --> 00:01:41.400
- UH, WHAT--
WHAT, YOU A GAY PIMP?

00:01:41.433 --> 00:01:43.569
- I'M NOT A PIMP.
I'M A CARPENTER.

00:01:43.602 --> 00:01:45.905
- CARPENTER?
[scoffs]

00:01:45.938 --> 00:01:47.874
THEN WHY DOES YOUR HOUSE
LOOK LIKE [bleep]?

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:50.776
- I'VE BEEN BUSY
WITH NON-CARPENTRY WORK.

00:01:50.809 --> 00:01:52.845
- OKAY, THAT'S IT.
BITCH, PACK YOUR [bleep].

00:01:52.878 --> 00:01:55.214
GET IN THE CARAVAN
AND MAKE ME SOME MONEY.

00:01:55.247 --> 00:01:57.783
- NO! AND I DON'T
HAVE ANY STUFF TO PACK.

00:01:57.816 --> 00:01:59.919
JESUS SAYS
WE DON'T NEED THINGS.

00:01:59.952 --> 00:02:02.288
- WHAT THE--
- IS THIS ALL ABOUT MONEY?

00:02:02.321 --> 00:02:04.257
- HELL, YEAH,
IT'S ALL ABOUT MONEY, BROTHA.

00:02:04.290 --> 00:02:07.827
- I HAVE A SAYING.
IT GOES LIKE THIS.

00:02:07.860 --> 00:02:09.829
- OH, YOU'RE GONNA LOVE THIS.
- SHUT UP.

00:02:09.862 --> 00:02:12.732
- IT'S EASIER FOR A CAMEL TO
PASS THROUGH THE EYE OF A NEEDLE

00:02:12.765 --> 00:02:15.768
THAN FOR A RICH MAN
TO ENTER THE KINGDOM OF GOD.

00:02:15.801 --> 00:02:17.270
- WHEW.
- OH, YEAH?

00:02:17.303 --> 00:02:19.672
WELL, I GOT A SAYING TOO.

00:02:19.705 --> 00:02:22.942
IT'S EAS--YOU KNOW,
WHY DON'T YOU PASS YOUR OWN--

00:02:22.975 --> 00:02:24.810
PASS YOUR ASS
THROUGH THE NEED--

00:02:24.843 --> 00:02:26.712
MAN, [bleep] YOU, MAN.
COME ON!

00:02:26.745 --> 00:02:28.714
- THE GIRL STAYS.

00:02:28.747 --> 00:02:31.184
- WHAT? [grunts]
- OH!

00:02:31.217 --> 00:02:34.187
[heavenly music plays]

00:02:34.220 --> 00:02:35.688
♪ ♪

00:02:35.721 --> 00:02:37.823
- MOTHER[bleep],
I SLAP YOU,

00:02:37.856 --> 00:02:39.892
AND YOU WANT ME
TO HIT YOU ON THE OTHER CHEEK?

00:02:39.925 --> 00:02:41.394
THAT AIN'T GANGSTA.

00:02:41.427 --> 00:02:42.895
THIS [bleep] IS CRAZY.

00:02:42.928 --> 00:02:44.730
YOU CAN HAVE HIM.
I'M DONE.

00:02:44.763 --> 00:02:46.566
- WAIT, FRIEND.

00:02:46.599 --> 00:02:48.534
[opera music plays]

00:02:48.567 --> 00:02:50.937
SO YOU KNOW THAT THERE ARE
NO HARD FEELINGS,

00:02:50.970 --> 00:02:54.240
WOULD YOU CARE
TO JOIN US FOR DINNER?

00:02:54.273 --> 00:02:57.210
- WHAT Y'ALL HAVIN'?

00:02:57.243 --> 00:02:59.043
- [operatic singing]
♪ ♪

